AFU Scale Reader is an independent, community-maintained interoperability
project. It is not affiliated with, authorized by, or endorsed by AFU,
Welland, or any related manufacturer. Product and company names remain the
property of their respective owners.

The implementation uses publicly observable Bluetooth interoperability facts
and independently implements the published CUN-BAE mathematical formula. The
references used for protocol comparison and algorithm evaluation are listed in
docs/body-composition-algorithm.md. No third-party source code is bundled and
the Swift package has no third-party package dependencies.
